#!/usr/bin/env qore
# -*- mode: qore; indent-tabs-mode: nil -*-
# the destructor that the module cleanup runs at the end of the process submits the first asynchronous I/O operation
# of the process, so the cleanup starts the I/O threads: the process ends (qore#6928)

%requires CleanupFirstSubmit

Holder::start();
printf("started\n");
